  {
   "id": "examples-lambdas-md-6",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "Passing a function by name (`apply(double, 21)`) fails for the same reason: a\nfunction name is not a value. Until then, use named functions and `|>`.\n",
